e. Possible values: o HIDDEN o VISIBLE ColumnHeaderStyle -&gt; (structure) The table cell style of the column header. Visibility -&gt; (string) The visibility of the table cells. Possible values: o HIDDEN o VISIBLE FontConfiguration -&gt; (structure) The font configuration of the table cells. FontSize -&gt; (structure) The option that determines the text display size. Relative -&gt; (string) The lexical name for the text size, proportional to its surrounding context. Possible values: o EXTRA_SMALL o SMALL o MEDIUM o LARGE o EXTRA_LARGE Absolute -&gt; (string) The font size that you want to use in px. FontDecoration -&gt; (string) Determines the appearance of dec- orative lines on the text. Possible values: o UNDERLINE o NONE FontColor -&gt; (string) Determines the color of the text. Constraints: o pattern: ^#[A-F0-9]{6}$ FontWeight -&gt; (structure) The option that determines the text display weight, or boldness. Name -&gt; (string) The lexical name for the level of boldness of the text display. Possible values: o NORMAL o BOLD FontStyle -&gt; (string) Determines the text display face that is inherited by the given font family. Possible values: o NORMAL o ITALIC FontFamily -&gt; (string) The font family that you want to use. Constraints: o max: 256 TextWrap -&gt; (string) The text wrap (none, wrap) for the table cells. Possible values: o NONE o WRAP HorizontalTextAlignment -&gt; (string) The horizontal text alignment (left, center, right, auto) for the table cells. Possible values: o LEFT o CENTER o RIGHT o AUTO VerticalTextAlignment -&gt; (string) The vertical text alignment (top, middle, bottom) for the table cells. Possible values: o TOP o MIDDLE o BOTTOM o AUTO BackgroundColor -&gt; (string) The background color for the table cells. Constraints: o pattern: ^#[A-F0-9]{6}$ Height -&gt; (integer) The height color for the table cells. Constraints: o min: 8 o max: 500 Border -&gt; (structure) The borders for the table cells. UniformBorder -&gt; (structure) Determines