le -&gt; (string) Determines the text display face that is inherited by the given font family. Possible values: o NORMAL o ITALIC FontFamily -&gt; (string) The font family that you want to use. Constraints: o max: 256 CustomLabel -&gt; (string) The text for the label. Position -&gt; (string) The positions for the legend. Choose one of the following options: o AUTO o RIGHT o BOTTOM o LEFT Possible values: o AUTO o RIGHT o BOTTOM o TOP Width -&gt; (string) The width of the legend. If this value is omitted, a default width is used when rendering. Height -&gt; (string) The height of the legend. If this value is omitted, a default height is used when rendering. ValueFontConfiguration -&gt; (structure) Configures the display properties of the given text. FontSize -&gt; (structure) The option that determines the text display size. Relative -&gt; (string) The lexical name for the text size, proportional to its sur- rounding context. Possible values: o EXTRA_SMALL o SMALL o MEDIUM o LARGE o EXTRA_LARGE Absolute -&gt; (string) The font size that you want to use in px. FontDecoration -&gt; (string) Determines the appearance of decora- tive lines on the text. Possible values: o UNDERLINE o NONE FontColor -&gt; (string) Determines the color of the text. Constraints: o pattern: ^#[A-F0-9]{6}$ FontWeight -&gt; (structure) The option that determines the text display weight, or boldness. Name -&gt; (string) The lexical name for the level of boldness of the text display. Possible values: o NORMAL o BOLD FontStyle -&gt; (string) Determines the text display face that is inherited by the given font family. Possible values: o NORMAL o ITALIC FontFamily -&gt; (string) The font family that you want to use. Constraints: o max: 256 Tooltip -&gt; (structure) The tooltip display setup of the visual. TooltipVisibility -&gt; (string) Determines whether or not the tooltip is visible. Possible values: o HIDDEN o VISIBLE SelectedTooltipType -&gt; (string) The selected type for the tooltip. Choose o