id, only one of the attrib- utes can be de- fined. StringValues -&gt; (list) A list of string-type parameter values. Constraints: o max: 50000 (string) IntegerValues -&gt; (list) A list of integer-type parameter values. Constraints: o max: 50000 (long) DecimalValues -&gt; (list) A list of decimal-type parameter values. Constraints: o max: 50000 (double) DateTimeValues -&gt; (list) A list of date- time-type parameter values. Constraints: o max: 50000 (timestamp) SelectAllValueOptions -&gt; (string) The configuration that selects all options. Possible values: o ALL_VALUES SourceParameterName -&gt; (string) The source parame- ter name of the destination parame- ter. SourceField -&gt; (string) The source field ID of the destination parameter. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 512 SourceColumn -&gt; (structure) A column of a data set. DataSetIdentifier -&gt; (string) The data set that the column belongs to. Constraints: o min: 0 o max: 2048 TopicIdentifier -&gt; (string) The topic that the column be- longs to. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 2048 ColumnName -&gt; (string) [required] The name of the column. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 128 VisualContentAltText -&gt; (string) The alt text for the visual. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 1024 GeocodingPreferences -&gt; (list) The geocoding prefences for geospatial map. Constraints: o min: 0 o max: 200 (structure) The geocode preference. RequestKey -&gt; (structure) [required] The unique request key for the geocode preference. Country -&gt; (string) The country value for the preference hierarchy. Constraints: o min: 0 o max: 3000 State -&gt; (string) The state/region value for the pref- erence hierarchy. Constraints: o min: 0 o max: 3000 County -&gt; (string) The county/district value for the preference hierarchy. Constraints: o min: 0 o max: 3000 City -&gt; (string) The city value for the preference hierarchy. Constraints: o min: 0 o max: 3000 PostCode -&gt; (string) The postcode value for the prefer- ence hierarchy. Constraints: o min