u- ration. Null- String -&gt; (string) [re- quired] De- ter- mines the null string of null val- ues. Con- straints: o min: 1 o max: 128 CurrencyDis- playFormatCon- figuration -&gt; (structure) The options that deter- mine the currency display for- mat configu- ration. Prefix -&gt; (string) Deter- mines the pre- fix value of the cur- rency format. Con- straints: o min: 1 o max: 128 Suffix -&gt; (string) Deter- mines the suf- fix value of the cur- rency format. Con- straints: o min: 1 o max: 128 Separator- Configura- tion -&gt; (structure) The op- tions that de- termine the nu- meric separa- tor con- figura- tion. Deci- malSepa- rator -&gt; (string) De- ter- mines the deci- mal sepa- ra- tor. Pos- sible val- ues: o COMMA o DOT o SPACE Thou- sandsSep- arator -&gt; (struc- ture) The op- tions that de- ter- mine the thou- sands sepa- rator con- figu- ra- tion. Sym- bol -&gt; (string) De- ter- mines the thou- sands sep- a- ra- tor sym- bol. Pos- si- ble val- ues: o COMMA o DOT o SPACE Visi- bil- ity -&gt; (string) De- ter- mines the vis- i- bil- ity of the thou- sands sep- a- ra- tor. Pos- si- ble val- ues: o HID- DEN o VIS- I- BLE Group- in- gStyle -&gt; (string) De- ter- mines the way num- bers are styled to ac- com- mo- date dif- fer- ent read- abil- ity stan- dards. The DE- FAULT value uses the stan- dard in- ter- na- tional group- ing sys- tem and groups num- bers by the thou- sands. The LAKHS value uses the In- dian num- ber- ing sys- tem and groups num- bers by lakhs and crores. Pos- si- ble val- ues: o DE- FAULT o LAKHS Symbol -&gt; (string) Deter- mines the sym- bol for the cur- rency format. Con- straints: o pat- tern: [A-Z]{3} Deci- malPlacesCon- figuration -&gt; (struc- ture) The op- tion that de- termines the dec- imal places configu- ration. Deci- malPlaces -&gt; (long) [re- quired] The val- ues of the deci- mal places. Con- straints: o min: 0 o max: 20 NumberScale -&gt; (string) Deter- mines the num- ber scale value for the currency format. Possible values: