e se- ries. Possible values: o HIDDEN o VISIBLE LineInterpolation -&gt; (string) Interpolation style for line series. o LINEAR : Show as default, linear style. o SMOOTH : Show as a smooth curve. o STEPPED : Show steps in line. Possible values: o LINEAR o SMOOTH o STEPPED LineStyle -&gt; (string) Line style for line series. o SOLID : Show as a solid line. o DOTTED : Show as a dotted line. o DASHED : Show as a dashed line. Possible values: o SOLID o DOTTED o DASHED LineWidth -&gt; (string) Width that determines the line thickness. MarkerStyleSettings -&gt; (structure) Marker styles options for all line se- ries in the visual. MarkerVisibility -&gt; (string) Configuration option that determines whether to show the markers in the series. Possible values: o HIDDEN o VISIBLE MarkerShape -&gt; (string) Shape option for markers in the se- ries. o CIRCLE : Show marker as a circle. o TRIANGLE : Show marker as a trian- gle. o SQUARE : Show marker as a square. o DIAMOND : Show marker as a dia- mond. o ROUNDED_SQUARE : Show marker as a rounded square. Possible values: o CIRCLE o TRIANGLE o SQUARE o DIAMOND o ROUNDED_SQUARE MarkerSize -&gt; (string) Size of marker in the series. MarkerColor -&gt; (string) Color of marker in the series. Constraints: o pattern: ^#[A-F0-9]{6}$ DecalSettings -&gt; (structure) Decal settings for all series in the vi- sual. ElementValue -&gt; (string) Field value of the field that you are setting the decal pattern to. Applicable only for field level set- tings. Constraints: o max: 1024 DecalVisibility -&gt; (string) Visibility setting for the decal pattern. Possible values: o HIDDEN o VISIBLE DecalColor -&gt; (string) Color configuration for the decal pattern. Constraints: o pattern: ^#[A-F0-9]{6}(?:[A-F0-9]{2})?$ DecalPatternType -&gt; (string) Type of pattern used for the decal, such as solid, diagonal, or circular patterns in various sizes. o SOLID : Solid fill pattern. o DIAGONAL_SMALL : Small diagonal stripes pattern. o DIAGONAL_MEDIUM : Medium diagonal stripes pattern. o DIAGONAL_LARGE : Large diagonal stripes pattern. o DIAGONAL_OPPOSITE_SMALL : Small cross-diagonal stripes pattern. o DIAGONAL_OPPOSITE_MEDIUM : Medium cross-diagonal stripes pattern. o DIAGONAL_OPPOSITE_LARGE : Large cross-diagonal stripes pattern. o CIRCLE_SMALL : Small circle pat- tern. o CIRCLE_MEDIUM : Medium circle pat- tern. o CIRCLE_LARGE : Large circle pat- tern. o DIAMOND_SMALL : Small diamonds pattern. o DIAMOND_MEDIUM : Medium diamonds pattern. o DIAMOND_LARGE : Large diamonds pattern. o DIAMOND_GRID_SMALL : Small diamond grid pattern. o DIAMOND_GRID_MEDIUM : Medium dia- mond grid pattern. o DIAMOND_GRID_LARGE : Large diamond grid pattern. o CHECKERBOARD_SMALL : Small checkerboard pattern. o CHECKERBOARD_MEDIUM : Medium checkerboard pattern. o CHECKERBOARD_LARGE : Large checkerboard pattern. o TRIANGLE_SMALL : Small triangles pattern. o TRIANGLE_MEDIUM : Medium triangles pattern. o TRIANGLE_LARGE : Large triangles pattern. Possible values: o SOLID o DIAGONAL_MEDIUM o CIRCLE_MEDIUM o DIAMOND_GRID_MEDIUM o CHECKERBOARD_MEDIUM o TRIANGLE_MEDIUM o DIAGONAL_OPPOSITE_MEDIUM o DIAMOND_MEDIUM o DIAGONAL_LARGE o CIRCLE_LARGE o DIAMOND_GRID_LARGE o CHECKERBOARD_LARGE o TRIANGLE_LARGE o DIAGONAL_OPPOSITE_LARGE o DIAMOND_LARGE o DIAGONAL_SMALL o CIRCLE_SMALL o DIAMOND_GRID_SMALL o CHECKERBOARD_SMALL o TRIANGLE_SMALL o DIAGONAL_OPPOSITE_SMALL o DIAMOND_SMALL DecalStyleType -&gt; (string) Style type for the decal, which can be either manual or automatic. This field is only applicable for line series. o Manual : Apply manual line and marker configuration for line se- ries. o Auto : Apply automatic line and marker configuration for line se- ries. Possible values: o Manual o Auto BorderSettings -&gt; (structure) Border settings for all bar series in the visual. BorderVisibility -&gt; (string) Visibility setting for the border. Possible values: o HIDDEN o VISIBLE BorderWidth -&gt; (string) Width of the border. Valid range is from 1px to 8px. BorderColor -&gt; (string) Color of the border. Constraints: o pattern: ^#[A-F0-9]{6}(?:[A-F0-9]{2})?$ Series -&gt; (list) The series item configuration of a Com- boChartVisual . Constraints: o max: 2000 (structure) The series item configuration of a Com- boChartVisual . This is a union type structure. For this structure to be valid, only one of the attributes can be defined. FieldComboSeriesItem -&gt; (structure) The field series item configuration of a ComboChartVisual . FieldId -&gt; (string) [required] Field ID of the field for which you are setting the series con- figuration. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 512 Settings -&gt; (structure) Options that determine the pre- sentation of series associated to the field. LineStyleSettings -&gt; (structure) Line styles options for the line series in the visual. LineVisibility -&gt; (string) Configuration option that determines whether to show the line for the series. Possible values: o HIDDEN o VISIBLE LineInterpolation -&gt; (string) Interpolation style for line series. o LINEAR : Show as de- fault, linear style. o SMOOTH : Show as a smooth curve. o STEPPED : Show steps in line. Possible values: o LINEAR o SMOOTH o STEPPED LineStyle -&gt; (string) Line style for line se- ries. o SOLID : Show as a solid line. o DOTTED : Show as a dot- ted line. o DASHED : Show as a dashed line. Possible values: o SOLID o DOTTED o DASHED LineWidth -&gt; (string) Width that determines the line thickness. MarkerStyleSettings -&gt; (struc- ture) Marker styles options for the line series in the visual. MarkerVisibility -&gt; (string) Configuration option that determines whether to show the markers in the series. Possible values: o HIDDEN o VISIBLE MarkerShape -&gt; (string) Shape option for markers in the series. o CIRCLE : Show marker as a circle. o TRIANGLE : Show marker as a triangle. o SQUARE : Show marker as a square. o DIAMOND : Show marker as a diamond. o ROUNDED_SQUARE : Show marker as a rounded square. Possible values: o CIRCLE o TRIANGLE o