 ibility of the thou- sands separa- tor. Possible values: o HIDDEN o VISI- BLE Group- ingStyle -&gt; (string) Deter- mines the way numbers are styled to ac- commo- date differ- ent read- ability stan- dards. The DE- FAULT value uses the standard interna- tional grouping system and groups numbers by the thou- sands. The LAKHS value uses the Indian number- ing sys- tem and groups numbers by lakhs and crores. Possible values: o DE- FAULT o LAKHS DecimalPlacesCon- figuration -&gt; (structure) The option that determines the decimal places configuration. DecimalPlaces -&gt; (long) [re- quired] The values of the deci- mal places. Constraints: o min: 0 o max: 20 NumberScale -&gt; (string) Determines the number scale value of the number format. Possible val- ues: o NONE o AUTO o THOUSANDS o MILLIONS o BILLIONS o TRILLIONS o LAKHS o CRORES NegativeValueCon- figuration -&gt; (structure) The options that determine the negative value configu- ration. DisplayMode -&gt; (string) [re- quired] Determines the display mode of the negative value con- figuration. Possible values: o POSITIVE o NEGATIVE NullValueFormatCon- figuration -&gt; (structure) The options that determine the null value format configu- ration. NullString -&gt; (string) [re- quired] Determines the null string of null values. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 128 CurrencyDisplayFormat- Configuration -&gt; (structure) The options that determine the cur- rency display for- mat configuration. Prefix -&gt; (string) Determines the prefix value of the currency format. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 128 Suffix -&gt; (string) Determines the suffix value of the currency format. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 128 SeparatorConfigura- tion -&gt; (structure) The options that determine the numeric separator con- figuration. DecimalSepara- tor -&gt; (string) Determines the decimal separator. Possible values: o COMMA o DOT o SPACE ThousandsSepa- rator -&gt; (structure) The options that deter- mine the thousands separator configura- tion. Symb