DDEN o VISIBLE MeasureLabelVisibility -&gt; (string) Determines the visibility of the measure field labels. Possible values: o HIDDEN o VISIBLE DataLabelTypes -&gt; (list) The option that determines the data la- bel type. Constraints: o max: 100 (structure) The option that determines the data label type. This is a union type structure. For this structure to be valid, only one of the attributes can be defined. FieldLabelType -&gt; (structure) Determines the label configura- tion for the entire field. FieldId -&gt; (string) Indicates the field that is targeted by the field label. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 512 Visibility -&gt; (string) The visibility of the field label. Possible values: o HIDDEN o VISIBLE DataPathLabelType -&gt; (structure) The option that specifies indi- vidual data values for labels. FieldId -&gt; (string) The field ID of the field that the data label needs to be applied to. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 512 FieldValue -&gt; (string) The actual value of the field that is labeled. Constraints: o max: 2048 Visibility -&gt; (string) The visibility of the data label. Possible values: o HIDDEN o VISIBLE RangeEndsLabelType -&gt; (structure) Determines the label configura- tion for range end value in a vi- sual. Visibility -&gt; (string) The visibility of the range ends label. Possible values: o HIDDEN o VISIBLE MinimumLabelType -&gt; (structure) Determines the label configura- tion for the minimum value in a visual. Visibility -&gt; (string) The visibility of the minimum label. Possible values: o HIDDEN o VISIBLE MaximumLabelType -&gt; (structure) Determines the label configura- tion for the maximum value in a visual. Visibility -&gt; (string) The visibility of the maximum label. Possible values: o HIDDEN o VISIBLE Position -&gt; (string) Determines the position of the data la- bels. Possible values: o INSIDE o OUTSIDE o LEFT o TOP o BOTTOM o RIGHT LabelContent -&gt; (string) Determines the content of the data la- bels. Possible values: o VALUE o PERCENT