ARGE o EXTRA_LARGE Absolute -&gt; (string) The font size that you want to use in px. FontDecoration -&gt; (string) Determines the appearance of dec- orative lines on the text. Possible values: o UNDERLINE o NONE FontColor -&gt; (string) Determines the color of the text. Constraints: o pattern: ^#[A-F0-9]{6}$ FontWeight -&gt; (structure) The option that determines the text display weight, or boldness. Name -&gt; (string) The lexical name for the level of boldness of the text display. Possible values: o NORMAL o BOLD FontStyle -&gt; (string) Determines the text display face that is inherited by the given font family. Possible values: o NORMAL o ITALIC FontFamily -&gt; (string) The font family that you want to use. Constraints: o max: 256 CustomLabel -&gt; (string) The text for the label. Position -&gt; (string) The positions for the legend. Choose one of the following options: o AUTO o RIGHT o BOTTOM o LEFT Possible values: o AUTO o RIGHT o BOTTOM o TOP Width -&gt; (string) The width of the legend. If this value is omitted, a default width is used when rendering. Height -&gt; (string) The height of the legend. If this value is omitted, a default height is used when rendering. ValueFontConfiguration -&gt; (structure) Configures the display properties of the given text. FontSize -&gt; (structure) The option that determines the text display size. Relative -&gt; (string) The lexical name for the text size, proportional to its sur- rounding context. Possible values: o EXTRA_SMALL o SMALL o MEDIUM o LARGE o EXTRA_LARGE Absolute -&gt; (string) The font size that you want to use in px. FontDecoration -&gt; (string) Determines the appearance of decora- tive lines on the text. Possible values: o UNDERLINE o NONE FontColor -&gt; (string) Determines the color of the text. Constraints: o pattern: ^#[A-F0-9]{6}$ FontWeight -&gt; (structure) The option that determines the text display weight, or boldness. Name -&gt; (string) The lexical name for the level of boldness of the text display. Possible values: o NORMAL o BOLD FontStyle -&gt; (string) Determines the text display face that is inherited by the given font family. Possible values: o NORMAL o ITALIC FontFamily -&gt; (string) The font family that you want to use. Constraints: o max: 256 DataLabels -&gt; (structure) The options that determine if visual data labels are displayed. Visibility -&gt; (string) Determines the visibility of the data labels. Possible values: o HIDDEN o VISIBLE CategoryLabelVisibility -&gt; (string) Determines the visibility of the cate- gory field labels. Possible values: o HIDDEN o VISIBLE MeasureLabelVisibility -&gt; (string) Determines the visibility of the measure field labels. Possible values: o HIDDEN o VISIBLE DataLabelTypes -&gt; (list) The option that determines the data la- bel type. Constraints: o max: 100 (structure) The option that determines the data label type. This is a union type structure. For this structure to be valid, only one of the attributes can be defined. FieldLabelType -&gt; (structure) Determines the label configura- tion for the entire field. FieldId -&gt; (string) Indicates the field that is targeted by the field label. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 512 Visibility -&gt; (string) The visibility of the field label. Possible values: o HIDDEN o VISIBLE DataPathLabelType -&gt; (structure) The option that specifies indi- vidual data values for labels. FieldId -&gt; (string) The field ID of the field that the data label needs to be applied to. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 512 FieldValue -&gt; (string) The actual value of the field that is labeled. Constraints: o max: 2048 Visibility -&gt; (string) The visibility of the data label. Possible values: o HIDDEN o VISIBLE RangeEndsLabelType -&gt; (structure) Determines the label configura- tion for range end value in a vi- sual. Visibility -&gt; (string) The visibility of the range ends label. Possible values: o HIDDEN o VISIBLE MinimumLabelType -&gt; (structure) Determines the label configura- tion 