ion -&gt; (structure) The sort configuration of a KPI visual. TrendGroupSort -&gt; (list) The sort configuration of the trend group fields. Constraints: o max: 100 (structure) The field sort options in a chart configuration. FieldSort -&gt; (structure) The sort configuration for a field in a field well. FieldId -&gt; (string) [required] The sort configuration target field. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 512 Direction -&gt; (string) [required] The sort direction. Choose one of the following options: o ASC : Ascending o DESC : Descending Possible values: o ASC o DESC ColumnSort -&gt; (structure) The sort configuration for a col- umn that is not used in a field well. SortBy -&gt; (structure) [required] A column of a data set. DataSetIdentifier -&gt; (string) The data set that the col- umn belongs to. Constraints: o min: 0 o max: 2048 TopicIdentifier -&gt; (string) The topic that the column belongs to. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 2048 ColumnName -&gt; (string) [re- quired] The name of the column. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 128 Direction -&gt; (string) [required] The sort direction. Possible values: o ASC o DESC AggregationFunction -&gt; (struc- ture) The aggregation function that is defined in the column sort. NumericalAggregationFunction -&gt; (structure) Aggregation for numerical values. SimpleNumericalAggregation -&gt; (string) Built-in aggregation functions for numeri- cal values. o SUM : The sum of a dimension or mea- sure. o AVERAGE : The aver- age of a dimension or measure. o MIN : The minimum value of a dimension or measure. o MAX : The maximum value of a dimension or measure. o COUNT : The count of a dimension or mea- sure. o DISTINCT_COUNT : The count of distinct values in a dimen- sion or measure. o VAR : The variance of a dimension or measure. o VARP : The parti- tioned variance of a dimension or mea- sure. o STDEV : The standard deviation of a di- mension or measure. o STDEVP : The parti- tioned standard de- viation of a dimen- sion or measure. o MEDIAN : 