ired] THe URL link of the CustomAc- tionURLOperation . Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 2048 URLTarget -&gt; (string) [required] The target of the CustomAc- tionURLOperation . Valid values are defined as follows: o NEW_TAB : Opens the target URL in a new browser tab. o NEW_WINDOW : Opens the tar- get URL in a new browser window. o SAME_TAB : Opens the target URL in the same browser tab. Possible values: o NEW_TAB o NEW_WINDOW o SAME_TAB SetParametersOperation -&gt; (struc- ture) The set parameter operation that sets parameters in custom action. ParameterValueConfigurations -&gt; (list) [required] The parameter that determines the value configuration. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 200 (structure) The configuration of adding parameters in ac- tion. DestinationParameterName -&gt; (string) [required] The destination para- meter name of the Set- ParameterValueConfigu- ration . Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 2048 o pattern: ^[a-zA-Z0-9]+$ Value -&gt; (structure) [re- quired] The configuration of destination parameter values. This is a union type structure. For this structure to be valid, only one of the at- tributes can be de- fined. CustomValuesConfigura- tion -&gt; (structure) The configuration of custom values for destination pa- rameter in Destina- tionParameterValue- Configuration . IncludeNullValue -&gt; (boolean) Includes the null value in custom action parameter val- ues. CustomValues -&gt; (structure) [re- quired] The customized parameter val- ues. This is a union type structure. For this struc- ture to be valid, only one of the attrib- utes can be de- fined. StringValues -&gt; (list) A list of string-type parameter values. Constraints: o max: 50000 (string) IntegerValues -&gt; (list) A list of integer-type parameter values. Constraints: o max: 50000 (long) DecimalValues -&gt; (list) A list of decimal-type parameter values. Constraints: o max: 50000 (double) DateTimeValues -&gt; (list) A list of date- time-type parameter values. Constraints: o max: 50000 (timestamp) Sel